  "frontier_coordinate": "R-162 is the direct A13 frontier. At the fixed side-16 d=3 A1 symbol and positive A7 floor, one strict-lower-shift resolvent treats the actual shifted-state read along every finite acyclic single pure-dyadic deterministic-matrix chain. The new p-to-4p origin acceleration is cancelled by the registered centered stationary exact-Fourier full-action identity, so the R-160 4/25 origin gap transfers to the recursive controller pullback. Exact dyadic synthesis, Q-Q0 cancellation before norms, and one complete source/current/trace/projected-force/sextic modulus give an analytic radius uniform in finite chain length, starting mode, finite cutoff, and admitted regulator; the pullback stays above 13/100 and above 1/10 of the induced recursive Gram. No intrinsic Hessian, unrelated forest, random/nonlinear or revisit law, pathwise conditional estimate, removal, T-050, A13, Nelson, phase/PDE, or Sector-A closure follows. Freeze this single-chain boundary and move the main lane to the truth-first T-054 candidate-functional tournament without privileging BCC, any morphology, or any PDE; T-052 remains closed for pinned M1 and T-053 is reserved for survivors.",
